title: "MIA: Multi-patient Intracranial EEG Analysis"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself (this file,
  in the version you actually ran) and the paper listed under
  preferred-citation. Citing the version credits every contributor to that
  release, not only the authors of the introductory paper.
