abstract: >-
  A Matlab toolbox for the group-level analysis of intracerebral EEG
  (SEEG/iEEG) signals recorded in multiple patients.
keywords:
  - intracranial EEG
  - SEEG
  - iEEG
  - electrophysiology
  - Matlab
  - Brainstorm
